  <Docs>
    <summary>Builder class for <c>SurfaceControl</c> objects.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Builder class for <c>SurfaceControl</c> objects.

            By default the surface will be hidden, and have "unset" bounds, meaning it can
            be as large as the bounds of its parent if a buffer or child so requires.

            It is necessary to set at least a name via <c>Builder#setName</c></para>
